# Testing

Agent policy
- Do **not** add, modify, or run tests unless the user directly asks — `.cursor/rules/05-workflow-execution.mdc` and `testing-vitest-nuxt.mdc`.

Unit and integration (Vitest)
- Configs in app/vitest.config.ts, app/vitest.config.coverage.ts, app/vitest.config.all.ts
- Run all: pnpm test (TZ=UTC)
- Coverage: pnpm test:coverage
- Crypto-only: pnpm test:crypto
- Many suites under:
  - app/server/api/__tests__ (route handlers)
  - app/server/services/**/__tests__ (services, forecast engine)
  - app/lib/__tests__ and app/schema/__tests__
  - app/pages/__tests__

Forecast engine tests
- Runner: pnpm test:forecast (tsx server/services/forecast/__tests__/test-runner.ts)
- Unit: pnpm test:forecast:unit
- Integration: pnpm test:forecast:integration
- Performance: pnpm test:forecast:performance

E2E (Playwright)
- app/tests/e2e/specs/* with public and authed projects; visual snapshots under *.spec.ts-snapshots/
- Run: pnpm test:e2e
- Update snapshots locally: pnpm test:e2e:update-snapshots
- Update vs staging (Linux snapshots): .github/workflows/e2e-update-staging-snapshots.yml

Test helpers
- app/tests/helpers/prismaMock.ts — mocking Prisma where needed
- app/tests/helpers/mockConstructable.ts — Vitest 4 constructable class mocks (`new`); never use arrow `mockImplementation` for classes
- app/server/api/__tests__/fixtures/dbUserForSession.ts — fixtures

CI nuances
- PR workflow generates Prisma client before tests
- Minimal envs set in workflows; tests avoid real DB/Redis by design unless explicitly required
